      "title": "UNION 与 UNION ALL",
      "learningObjective": "能够运用本节知识完成：合并不同期间客户记录",
      "prerequisites": [
        "ch12"
      ],
      "concept": "UNION 合并并去重，UNION ALL 保留所有行及重复项；两侧必须具有相同列数。",
      "syntax": "SELECT col FROM a UNION [ALL] SELECT col FROM b ORDER BY col;",
      "parameters": {
        "ALL": "保留重复项"
      },
